
# Never in the image: it holds a live model key, and the deployment supplies the
# environment through compose instead.
.env

# Evidence and scratch from local runs. The image gets its own directories on a
# volume; a previous run's datasets travelling inside the image is the exact
# leak `roles/*/tools/workspace.py` exists to prevent.
#
# The patterns are anchored at every level, not just the context root: these
# live at `roles/<name>/workspaces/`, and a bare `workspaces/` matched only the
# root — so a run of angel's shipped in the image while appearing to be ignored.
runs/
**/runs/
**/workspaces/
**/datasets/
**/logs/

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
